          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL           APPSPOND LANE                                                  (east side)                                                   POTTERS CROUCH 9/248                                            The Cottage II House.  Mid C17.  Timber frame, exposed on N gable end and rear elevation.   C18 red brick casing to front and to rear ground floor.  C17 brick nogging to rear upper floor and N gable end. Plain tile roof with large ridge chimney stack of 4 joined square shafts.   Lobby-entrance plan.   1 bay each side of half-bay centre;   staircase attached to rear of stack.   2 storeys.   3 C19 glazing bar casements in pegged oak frames.  C19 door in C18 chamfered wood frame,  the openings each side with segmental heads.  N end has a C18 single storey lean-to addition. Listing NGR: TL1159005216"
    }
